Package: mrwin
Title: Causal Win Statistics
Version: 0.1.1.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Nguyen Thien", "Minh", email = "minhnt@ump.edu.vn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Nguyen Thien Minh [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Nguyen Thien Minh <minhnt@ump.edu.vn>
Description: R implementation of causal win-statistic methods for hierarchical
    composite endpoints with a polygenic-risk-score instrument (Mendelian
    randomization), including the hierarchical comparison kernel with a
    compiled sub-quadratic win/loss backend, adjacent-stratum causal win
    ratios, dose-standardised GLS pooling, Fieller confidence intervals,
    multiplier-bootstrap and analytic influence-function variance with GWAS
    uncertainty propagation, ordinal inverse-probability weighting, and SDPD
    MR-Egger diagnostics.
